  lines:
  - Hoo-hoo, another fool hungry for easy coin! <i>I'll read you like an open book
    out there</i> and shoot the stupid right out of you! Every weakness shows on
    the outside, and yours, amigo, I spotted a long time ago!
  postBattleWinLines:
  - <b><size=120%>OH GOD, MY MUSTACHE!!!</size></b> May your spaghetti always go
    cold, you sniveling brat!!!!!!
  postBattleLoseLines:
  - Run home to mama!
